Journey: Signing out ends the gateway session and the identity provider session
Tags: @gateway @logout
Role: employee

Log in
Open /
Click the "Sign out" link
Expect the page contains "Do you want to log out?"
Click the "Logout" button
Expect the page contains "Sign in to your account"
Expect the URL contains "gateway.ez.test"
# The app is out of reach until the next sign-in
Open /api/me
Expect the page contains "Sign in to your account"
